-- Issue #7, as it was filed: a collection the journey stipulated outright,
-- asked about through `all`. `box.items` is `{x}` and `x.kind = a`, so every
-- item is of kind a and the box can be sealed. This was undecided, with the
-- reason "`all` was called on a collection, which defines nothing".

journey EveryItemIsKindA {
    cast:
        box: Box
        x: Item
    given:
        x.kind = a
        box.sealed = false
    1. seal a box whose only item is of kind a
        stipulate box.items = {x}
        box does Seal(box) on Packing
        then box.sealed = true
}
